    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "とうとうJIF本番……！\nテンションマジメガハイパーMAXっす！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "024shk"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "024shk",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 7
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日のライブ配信、\n学校のみんなも見てくれてるんだよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "023har"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "023har",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 10
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "学校どころか世界中からだよ！\n俺たちすごい注目されてる！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "020hay"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "020hay",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 11
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。315プロダクションは『投票枠』で\n急遽参加が決まりましたからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "021jun"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "021jun",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 14
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "僕たちの存在は色んな意味で、\n注目を集めていると思いますよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "021jun"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "021jun",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 15
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……しかも、トップバッター……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "022nat"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "022nat",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 16
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おい、まだライブは始まんねーのかよ。\nオレ様を待たせるんじゃねぇ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "牙崎 漣"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "040ren"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "040ren",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 20
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "漣は早くステージに立ちたくて、ウズウズしている\nようだな。どこかで、もう少し体を動かしてくるか！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "円城寺 道流"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "039mcr"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "039mcr",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 24
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "円城寺さん、行くなら俺も混ぜてくれ。\n本番に向けて、もっと体を温めておきたいんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "大河 タケル"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "038tak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "038tak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 25
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "う～、ドキドキが止まんないよ。本番を待ってる\nこの時間って、緊張するね。ロールはどう？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "031sak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 28
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_a:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺も緊張してるよ。ライブ後に食べる\nケーキのことを考えて気を紛らわせてるけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "performance": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak"
      },
      "visual": {
        "entityType": "idol",
        "entityId": "030mak",
        "presence": "visible",
        "reason": "matching-visible-stage-actor",
        "source": "stage-snapshot",
        "snapshot": "entry",
        "stepId": 29
      },
      "diagnostics": [
        "compatibility-stage-evidence",
        "entry-settled-actor-difference"
      ],
      "inline_translation": null,
